# Title and the protagonist select (the first, Tsunanori) to a new game, then the story scenes and
# the tutorials read through by a cross every second, which reaches the first battle (the combat
# tutorial) at about 185 s. In battle each character takes its last tech (up from the first) or, when
# it lacks the BP, the second (down again), then engage and the tips and dialogue between; the
# united attacks this gives win it by 310-350 s. On the platform after it the same presses scan, and
# the circles close what is left open; l1 opens Save/Load, where Create New Saved Data is confirmed
# with Save (up from the default Cancel).
